stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> DRAFT: Cart configured & customer proceeds to checkout
    DRAFT --> PENDING_PAYMENT: Checkout submitted & PaymentIntent created
    PENDING_PAYMENT --> PAID: Payment gateway confirms capture
    PENDING_PAYMENT --> CANCELLED: Abandoned or expired session
    
    PAID --> IN_PRODUCTION: Order-Made (OM) garment job queued
    PAID --> READY_FOR_DISPATCH: Pre-made DROP batch allocated
    
    IN_PRODUCTION --> READY_FOR_DISPATCH: Final QC passed & packaging complete
    READY_FOR_DISPATCH --> SHIPPED: Courier tracking generated (Kathmandu dispatch)
    SHIPPED --> DELIVERED: Carrier confirms consignee delivery
    
    PAID --> REFUNDED: Cancelled prior to cutting (OM only)
    DELIVERED --> RETURNED: Return inspected & accepted (DROP only, 5-day window)
    
    CANCELLED --> [*]
    REFUNDED --> [*]
    RETURNED --> [*]
    DELIVERED --> [*]
